#. module: sale_lazada
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_lazada
msgid ""
"\n"
"Import your Lazada orders in Odoo and synchronize deliveries\n"
"============================================================\n"
"\n"
"Key Features\n"
"------------\n"
"* Import orders from multiple shops\n"
"* Orders are matched with Odoo products based on their internal reference "
"(SKU in Lazada)\n"
"* Support for both Fulfillment by Lazada (FBL), Fulfillment by Merchant "
"(FBM):\n"
"* FBL: Importing the completed orders\n"
"* FBM: Delivery information is fetched from Lazada, track and synchronize "
"the stock level to Lazada.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: sale_lazada
#: model:mail.template,body_html:sale_lazada.order_sync_failure
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>The synchronization of the Lazada order with reference <t "
"t-out=\"ctx.get('lazada_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> encountered an error and "
"was not completed.</p>\n"
"                <p>Unless the order is cancelled in Lazada, no other "
"synchronization will be attempted.</p>\n"
"                <p>To schedule a new synchronization attempt, proceed as "
"follows:\n"
"                    </p><ol>\n"
"                        <li>Enter the Developer Tools.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Open the form of the Lazada Shop on which the "
"order was placed.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Navigate to the Order Follow-up tab.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Set a date for <em>Last Order Synchronization "
"Date</em> that is anterior to the last status update of the order.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Save the changes and click on the <em>SYNC "
"ORDERS</em> button.</li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                \n"
"                <p>If the problem persists, contact <a href=\"https://"
"www.odoo.com/help/\">Odoo support</a>.</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Lazadaオーダ（参照番号<t t-out=\"ctx.get"
"('lazada_order_ref') or ''\">REF</t> ）の同期中にエラーが発生し、完了しません"
"でした。</p>\n"
"                <p>Lazadaでオーダがキャンセルされない限り、他の同期は試行され"
"ません。</p>\n"
"                <p>新しい同期試行をスケジュールするには、以下の手順に従ってく"
"ださい：\n"
"                   </p><ol> \n"
"                       <li> 開発者ツールを開きます。</li>\n"
"                        <li>オーダが行われたLazadaショップのフォームを開きま"
"す。</li>\n"
"                        <li>オーダフォローアップタブに移動します。</li>\n"
"                        <li> <em> オーダの最終ステータス更新日より前の日付を"
"オーダ同期最終日</em> に設定します。</li>\n"
"                        <li>変更を保存し、<em>オーダを同期</em> ボタンを"
"クリックします。</li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                \n"
"               <p> 問題が解決しない場合は、<a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/"
"help/\">Odooサポート</a> までご連絡ください。</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

#. module: sale_lazada
